# Project R8 keep rules, auto-combined by AGP from every file under
# src/<variant>/keepRules (see https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules).
#
# The bulk of the app's keep rules (kotlinx.serialization, Retrofit/OkHttp,
# Room, Hilt, ML Kit, Firebase, and the DTO/domain model packages) live in
# app/proguard-rules.pro, wired via proguardFiles(...) on the release build
# type in app/build.gradle.kts. This file only needs entries that are purely
# structural/source-set based rather than dependency-specific.

# Keep Parcelable CREATOR fields (Compose Navigation saved-state args).
-keepclassmembers class * implements android.os.Parcelable {
    public static final ** CREATOR;
}